{"id":"virtud","lemma":"virtud","pos":"noun","rank":3971,"glosses":["virtue"],"ipa":"/biɾˈtud/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"virtudes"},"order":3972,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-virtud.wav","examples":[{"text":"La paciencia es una virtud.","en":"Patience is a virtue.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"patience, forbearance"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La justicia y la bondad son virtudes.","en":"Justice and kindness are virtues.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"justice"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"goodness"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"La honestidad es una virtud.","en":"Honesty is a virtue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450201","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"honesty"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}